---
layout: default
title: Posts
description: Notes on Ruby, product architecture, teams, design, and the tools around the work.
page_class: posts-page
---

{% posts = collections.posts.resources.sort_by { |post| post.data.date }.reverse %}
{% featured = posts.first %}

<div class="mx-auto w-[min(1180px,calc(100%-2rem))]">
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="max-w-[10ch] text-[clamp(3.6rem,10vw,6rem)] font-black leading-[.88] tracking-[-.04em]">Notes from <strong class="text-fire-ink">the work.</strong></h1>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-[48ch] text-xl leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-2xl">Ruby, products, teams, interfaces, and the small decisions that keep systems moving.</p>
  </section>

  {% if featured %}
    <a href="{{ featured.relative_url }}" class="group grid py-7 text-inherit md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8 md:py-10">
      <figure class="project-media mb-7 overflow-hidden bg-white md:col-span-7 md:mb-0">
        <img src="{{ featured.data.cover }}" alt="" class="block h-auto w-full">
      </figure>
      <div class="md:col-span-5 md:self-end">
        <time datetime="{{ featured.data.date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') }}" class="font-black text-fire-ink">{{ featured.data.date.strftime("%d %b %Y") }}</time>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black leading-[.95] tracking-[-.03em] md:text-5xl">{{ featured.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-[44ch] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ featured.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="mt-7 inline-block font-black group-hover:text-fire-ink">Read the post →</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  {% end %}

  <section class="pb-16 pt-14 md:pb-28 md:pt-20">
    <h2 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-black tracking-[-.03em] md:text-5xl">Archive</h2>
    <div>
      {% posts.drop(1).each do |post| %}
        <a href="{{ post.relative_url }}" class="group grid gap-4 py-6 text-inherit md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center md:gap-6 md:py-8">
          <time datetime="{{ post.data.date.strftime('%Y-%m-%d') }}" class="font-black text-fire-ink md:col-span-2">{{ post.data.date.strftime("%Y · %d %b") }}</time>
          <div class="md:col-span-7">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black tracking-[-.02em] group-hover:text-fire-ink md:text-3xl">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-[64ch] leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          </div>
          {% if post.data.cover %}
            <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="" loading="lazy" class="block h-auto w-full self-start bg-white md:col-span-3">
          {% end %}
        </a>
      {% end %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
